      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d8d4b4356d6eca20bd30ca7901dc2254f6fd246313a8e35635966a6404bc0132--4510d002_2012.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2012\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 387ecd1d73f392049c03ee1816c9200d6c034135c3aad2742bcda3750139dcdf | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | c6b027f707b6b77b4101b88f6d088194304551fd6bc549c47d02fe62b98acea4 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | fc419f4618b9d16407284fc97a1fabfef698dfb117391d0426300a828c99f1eb | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 8c7f299c142ebaae5d74425dc8a8cc6fa5db3687fa6521c3faeab1985de61e93 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 2bf242bd1805e40cfbd4405d649345e5d5bd95dda18ef28d8bb60cc215729530 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 4acb0a65aa7d0357452abec556214c1b8c067a375d991d59e39b73dc699c4a25 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | cc0f9d7bf0abd297d98f6eb3b5df75a0c3f4428fa85fed7fbbb2818ddbbcaab5 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
